# The scanner the e2e ASH image installs beside ASH itself, with the extras and the
# version range ASH's bandit scanner asks for (BanditScannerConfigOptions.tool_version
# and _get_tool_package_extras). With all of them present, ASH runs the bandit on PATH
# instead of fetching one through `uv tool run`.
#
# detect-secrets is not here: it is an ASH runtime dependency, locked in uv.lock.
#
# scanner-requirements.txt is resolved against ASH's locked runtime and leaves out every
# package that runtime already pins. Regenerate it with deploy/kubernetes-operator/relock.sh,
# never by hand.
bandit[sarif,toml]>=1.7.0,<2.0.0
